# requires: saves
# The player at Kiz Kulesi (slot 10 = kayit9.sav; Demir's story, any locked body): five atilgan_ai enemies approach and damage the
# player (atilgan_yara.wdl:130/147: only within 150 of it). Which atilgan attacks first depends on the body (seed 0, Demir: the
# nearest, 878 -> 298 in 200 frames; Inzar: another one), so the check is: the body's health falls, and an atilgan is then at
# least 300 nearer than the nearest one was at the start.
realtime off
load-save 9
wait until LY_AktifLevelID == 31 && level_yuklendi_ok == 1 && player != 0 timeout 7200
assert $count(atilgan_ai) == 5
store hp0 $health
find enemy atilgan_ai
store d0 $dist(@enemy)
assert @enemy.skill1 > 0
wait until $health < @hp0 timeout 1800
find attacker atilgan_ai
assert $dist(@attacker) < @d0 - 300
capture kriz_attacked
